na ca śreyo.anupaśyāmi hatvā svajanamāhave', 'O Keśava! I see adverse omens and I do not perceive any good (to accrue) after killing (my) kinsmen in the battle.');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO passages (id, edition_id, corpus_version_id, canonical_ref, chapter, verse, speaker, checksum, review_status, release_eligible) VALUES ('gita.1.32', 'gita-standard-700', 'gita-1.0.0-rc.1', 'gita.1.32', 1, 32, 'Arjuna', '963d7d9b9a929022832b57f943891ccc8b8c3059840457ba372c82d904884c74', 'first review verified; second review pending', 0);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO text_representations (passage_id, kind, language, script, content, source_id) VALUES ('gita.1.32', 'original', 'sa', 'Deva', 'न काङ्क्षे विजयं कृष्ण न च राज्यं सुखानि च।
किं नो राज्येन गोविन्द किं भोगैर्जीवितेन वा ॥', 'vedic-scriptures');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO text_representations (passage_id, kind, language, script, content, source_id) VALUES ('gita.1.32', 'transliteration', 'sa', 'Latn', 'na kāṅkṣe vijayaṃ kṛṣṇa na ca rājyaṃ sukhāni ca
kiṃ no rājyena govinda kiṃ bhogairjīvitena vā', 'vedic-scriptures');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO text_representations (passage_id, kind, language, script, content, source_id) VALUES ('gita.1.32', 'translation', 'en', 'Latn', 'I do not wish for victory, O Kṛṣṇa! nor sovereignty, nor pleasures: what is sovereignty to us, O Govinda ! what enjoyments, and even life? Even those', 'telang-1882');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO passage_sources (passage_id, source_id, locator, role) VALUES ('gita.1.32', 'vedic-scriptures', 'BG1.32', 'Devanagari and IAST digital witness');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO passage_sources (passage_id, source_id, locator, role) VALUES ('gita.1.32', 'telang-1882', 'Chapter 1; aligned against BG1.32', 'English translation witness');
INSERT INTO passages_fts (canonical_ref, devanagari, iast, english) VALUES ('gita.1.32', 'न काङ्क्षे विजयं कृष्ण न च राज्यं सुखानि च।
