iṣubhiḥ pratiyotsyāmi pūjārhāvarisūdana', 'How, O destroyer of Madhu! shall I encounter with arrows in the battle Bhīṣma and Droṇa —both, O destroyer of enemies! entitled to reverence?');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO passages (id, edition_id, corpus_version_id, canonical_ref, chapter, verse, speaker, checksum, review_status, release_eligible) VALUES ('gita.2.5', 'gita-standard-700', 'gita-1.0.0-rc.1', 'gita.2.5', 2, 5, 'Arjuna', '493aaa13f37901cd3538b78b8903a7bfca562ca152f717b4eb4f78faaba37d26', 'first review verified; second review pending', 0);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO text_representations (passage_id, kind, language, script, content, source_id) VALUES ('gita.2.5', 'original', 'sa', 'Deva', 'गुरूनहत्वा हि महानुभावान्
श्रेयो भोक्तुं भैक्ष्यमपीह लोके।
हत्वार्थकामांस्तु गुरूनिहैव
भुञ्जीय भोगान् रुधिरप्रदिग्धान् ॥', 'vedic-scriptures');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO text_representations (passage_id, kind, language, script, content, source_id) VALUES ('gita.2.5', 'transliteration', 'sa', 'Latn', 'gurūnahatvā hi mahānubhāvān śreyo bhoktuṃ bhaikṣyamapīha loke
hatvārthakāmāṃstu gurūnihaiva bhuñjīya bhogān rudhirapradigdhān', 'vedic-scriptures');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO text_representations (passage_id, kind, language, script, content, source_id) VALUES ('gita.2.5', 'translation', 'en', 'Latn', 'Not killing (my) preceptors—(men) of great glory—it is better to live even on alms in this world. But killing them though they are avaricious of worldly goods I should only enjoy blood-tainted enjoyments. Nor do we know which of the two is better for us-whether that we should vanquish them', 'telang-1882');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO passage_sources (passage_id, source_id, locator, role) VALUES ('gita.2.5', 'vedic-scriptures', 'BG2.5', 'Devanagari and IAST digital witness');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO passage_sources (passage_id, source_id, locator, role) VALUES ('gita.2.5', 'telang-1882', 'Chapter 2; aligned against BG2.5', 'English translation witness');
