एवमुक्त्वा हृषीकेशं गुडाकेशः परन्तप।
न योत्स्य इति गोविन्दमुक्त्वा तूष्णीं बभूव ह ॥', 'sañjaya uvāca
evamuktvā hṛṣīkeśaṃ guḍākeśaḥ parantapaḥ
na yotsya iti govindamuktvā tūṣṇīṃ babhūva ha', 'Having spoken thus to Hriṣīkesa, O terror of (your) foes! Guḍākeśa said to Govinda , ''I shall not engage in battle;'' and verily remained silent. To him thus desponding between the two armies, O descendant of Bharata!');
