नानवाप्तमवाप्तव्यं वर्त एव च कर्मणि ॥', 'na me pārthāsti kartavyaṃ triṣu lokeṣu kiñcana
nānavāptamavāptavyaṃ varta eva ca karmaṇi', 'There is nothing, O son of Pṛthā! for me to do in (all) the three worlds, nothing to acquire which has not been acquired. Still I do engage in action. For should I at any time not engage without sloth in action');
