ahaṅkāravimūḍhātmā kartāhamiti manyate', 'He whose mind is deluded by egoism thinks himself the doer of the actions which');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO passages (id, edition_id, corpus_version_id, canonical_ref, chapter, verse, speaker, checksum, review_status, release_eligible) VALUES ('gita.3.28', 'gita-standard-700', 'gita-1.0.0-rc.1', 'gita.3.28', 3, 28, 'Krishna', 'e393c113fbb0de00216ac37734bdd4c8e6e0d3e717cf73330cb2aa3a014d21a7', 'first review verified; second review pending', 0);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO text_representations (passage_id, kind, language, script, content, source_id) VALUES ('gita.3.28', 'original', 'sa', 'Deva', 'तत्त्ववित्तु महाबाहो गुणकर्मविभागयोः।
गुणा गुणेषु वर्तन्त इति मत्वा न सज्जते ॥', 'vedic-scriptures');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO text_representations (passage_id, kind, language, script, content, source_id) VALUES ('gita.3.28', 'transliteration', 'sa', 'Latn', 'tattvavittu mahābāho guṇakarmavibhāgayoḥ
guṇā guṇeṣu vartanta iti matvā na sajjate', 'vedic-scriptures');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO text_representations (passage_id, kind, language, script, content, source_id) VALUES ('gita.3.28', 'translation', 'en', 'Latn', 'in every way are done by the qualities of nature. But he O you of mighty arms! who knows the truth about the difference from qualities and the difference from actions forms no attachments', 'telang-1882');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO passage_sources (passage_id, source_id, locator, role) VALUES ('gita.3.28', 'vedic-scriptures', 'BG3.28', 'Devanagari and IAST digital witness');
