tānyahaṃ veda sarvāṇi na tvaṃ vettha parantapa', 'I have passed through many births, O Arjuna I and you also. I know them all, but you, O terror of (your) foes! do not know them.');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO passages (id, edition_id, corpus_version_id, canonical_ref, chapter, verse, speaker, checksum, review_status, release_eligible) VALUES ('gita.4.6', 'gita-standard-700', 'gita-1.0.0-rc.1', 'gita.4.6', 4, 6, 'Krishna', '98710aff0087073025e6238f56d25a842710937ee383421e322a2b8a9ae9dbb9', 'first review verified; second review pending', 0);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO text_representations (passage_id, kind, language, script, content, source_id) VALUES ('gita.4.6', 'original', 'sa', 'Deva', 'अजोऽपि सन्नव्ययात्मा भूतानामीश्वरोऽपि सन्।
प्रकृतिं स्वामधिष्ठाय सम्भवाम्यात्ममायया ॥', 'vedic-scriptures');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO text_representations (passage_id, kind, language, script, content, source_id) VALUES ('gita.4.6', 'transliteration', 'sa', 'Latn', 'ajo.api sannavyayātmā bhūtānāmīśvaro.api san
prakṛtiṃ svāmadhiṣṭhāya sambhavāmyātmamāyayā', 'vedic-scriptures');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO text_representations (passage_id, kind, language, script, content, source_id) VALUES ('gita.4.6', 'translation', 'en', 'Latn', 'Even though I am unborn and inexhaustible in (my) essence even though I am lord of all beings still I take up the control of my own nature and am born by means of my delusive power.', 'telang-1882');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO passage_sources (passage_id, source_id, locator, role) VALUES ('gita.4.6', 'vedic-scriptures', 'BG4.6', 'Devanagari and IAST digital witness');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO passage_sources (passage_id, source_id, locator, role) VALUES ('gita.4.6', 'telang-1882', 'Chapter 4; aligned against BG4.6', 'English translation witness');
INSERT INTO passages_fts (canonical_ref, devanagari, iast, english) VALUES ('gita.4.6', 'अजोऽपि सन्नव्ययात्मा भूतानामीश्वरोऽपि सन्।
