ajñānenāvṛtaṃ jñānaṃ tena muhyanti jantavaḥ', 'The Lord receives no one''s sin, nor merit either. Knowledge is enveloped by ignorance');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO passages (id, edition_id, corpus_version_id, canonical_ref, chapter, verse, speaker, checksum, review_status, release_eligible) VALUES ('gita.5.16', 'gita-standard-700', 'gita-1.0.0-rc.1', 'gita.5.16', 5, 16, 'Krishna', 'ff408087cf229585431d9bc0803077f3850cd753d2520a1b0b10e9cad7d18c5b', 'first review verified; second review pending', 0);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO text_representations (passage_id, kind, language, script, content, source_id) VALUES ('gita.5.16', 'original', 'sa', 'Deva', 'ज्ञानेन तु तदज्ञानं येषां नाशितमात्मनः।
तेषामादित्यवज्ज्ञानं प्रकाशयति तत्परम् ॥', 'vedic-scriptures');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO text_representations (passage_id, kind, language, script, content, source_id) VALUES ('gita.5.16', 'transliteration', 'sa', 'Latn', 'jñānena tu tadajñānaṃ yeṣāṃ nāśitamātmanaḥ
teṣāmādityavajjñānaṃ prakāśayati tatparam', 'vedic-scriptures');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO text_representations (passage_id, kind, language, script, content, source_id) VALUES ('gita.5.16', 'translation', 'en', 'Latn', 'hence all creatures are deluded. But to those who have destroyed that ignorance by knowledge of the self, (such) knowledge like the sun', 'telang-1882');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO passage_sources (passage_id, source_id, locator, role) VALUES ('gita.5.16', 'vedic-scriptures', 'BG5.16', 'Devanagari and IAST digital witness');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO passage_sources (passage_id, source_id, locator, role) VALUES ('gita.5.16', 'telang-1882', 'Chapter 5; aligned against BG5.16', 'English translation witness');
INSERT INTO passages_fts (canonical_ref, devanagari, iast, english) VALUES ('gita.5.16', 'ज्ञानेन तु तदज्ञानं येषां नाशितमात्मनः।
