ayatiḥ śraddhayopeto yogāccalitamānasaḥ
aprāpya yogasaṃsiddhiṃ kāṃ gatiṃ kṛṣṇa gacchati', 'What is the end of him O Kṛṣṇa! who does not attain the consummation of his devotion being not assiduous and having a mind shaken off from devotion, (though) full of faith? Does he fallen from both (paths)');
