karmibhyaścādhiko yogī tasmādyogī bhavārjuna', 'The devotee is esteemed higher than the performers of penances, higher even than the men of knowledge, and the devotee is higher than the men of action therefore');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO passages (id, edition_id, corpus_version_id, canonical_ref, chapter, verse, speaker, checksum, review_status, release_eligible) VALUES ('gita.6.47', 'gita-standard-700', 'gita-1.0.0-rc.1', 'gita.6.47', 6, 47, 'Krishna', '1b6ec918eb16d384a3e592fc2dbe4828c73cab24441a632caa535c03f5afa2b6', 'first review verified; second review pending', 0);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO text_representations (passage_id, kind, language, script, content, source_id) VALUES ('gita.6.47', 'original', 'sa', 'Deva', 'योगिनामपि सर्वेषां मद्गतेनान्तरात्मना।
श्रद्धावान्भजते यो मां स मे युक्ततमो मतः ॥', 'vedic-scriptures');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO text_representations (passage_id, kind, language, script, content, source_id) VALUES ('gita.6.47', 'transliteration', 'sa', 'Latn', 'yogināmapi sarveṣāṃ madgatenāntarātmanā
śraddhāvānbhajate yo māṃ sa me yuktatamo mataḥ', 'vedic-scriptures');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO text_representations (passage_id, kind, language, script, content, source_id) VALUES ('gita.6.47', 'translation', 'en', 'Latn', 'O Arjuna! become a devotee. And even among all devotees he who being full of faith worships me with his inmost self intent on me is esteemed by me to be the most devoted.', 'telang-1882');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO passage_sources (passage_id, source_id, locator, role) VALUES ('gita.6.47', 'vedic-scriptures', 'BG6.47', 'Devanagari and IAST digital witness');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO passage_sources (passage_id, source_id, locator, role) VALUES ('gita.6.47', 'telang-1882', 'Chapter 6; aligned against BG6.47', 'English translation witness');
INSERT INTO passages_fts (canonical_ref, devanagari, iast, english) VALUES ('gita.6.47', 'योगिनामपि सर्वेषां मद्गतेनान्तरात्मना।
