ahamādirhi devānāṃ maharṣīṇāṃ ca sarvaśaḥ', 'Not the multitudes of gods, nor the great sages know my source for I am in every way the origin of the gods and great sages. Of (all) mortals he who knows me to be unborn without beginning');
