keṣu keṣu ca bhāveṣu cintyo.asi bhagavanmayā', 'How shall I know you, O you of mystic power! always meditating on you? And in what various entities, O lord! should I meditate on you?');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO passages (id, edition_id, corpus_version_id, canonical_ref, chapter, verse, speaker, checksum, review_status, release_eligible) VALUES ('gita.10.18', 'gita-standard-700', 'gita-1.0.0-rc.1', 'gita.10.18', 10, 18, 'Arjuna', 'd02c545697a08b5157d5a41eba3bc146e03ae78e0b909184b802eae1cab08227', 'first review verified; second review pending', 0);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO text_representations (passage_id, kind, language, script, content, source_id) VALUES ('gita.10.18', 'original', 'sa', 'Deva', 'विस्तरेणात्मनो योगं विभूतिं च जनार्दन।
भूयः कथय तृप्तिर्हि शृण्वतो नास्ति मेऽमृतम् ॥', 'vedic-scriptures');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO text_representations (passage_id, kind, language, script, content, source_id) VALUES ('gita.10.18', 'transliteration', 'sa', 'Latn', 'vistareṇātmano yogaṃ vibhūtiṃ ca janārdana
bhūyaḥ kathaya tṛptirhi śṛṇvato nāsti me.amṛtam', 'vedic-scriptures');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO text_representations (passage_id, kind, language, script, content, source_id) VALUES ('gita.10.18', 'translation', 'en', 'Latn', 'Again, O Ganārdana! do you yourself declare your powers and emanations because hearing this nectar, I (still) feel no satiety.', 'telang-1882');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO passage_sources (passage_id, source_id, locator, role) VALUES ('gita.10.18', 'vedic-scriptures', 'BG10.18', 'Devanagari and IAST digital witness');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO passage_sources (passage_id, source_id, locator, role) VALUES ('gita.10.18', 'telang-1882', 'Chapter 10; aligned against BG10.18', 'English translation witness');
INSERT INTO passages_fts (canonical_ref, devanagari, iast, english) VALUES ('gita.10.18', 'विस्तरेणात्मनो योगं विभूतिं च जनार्दन।
