सर्वे सहैवावनिपालसङ्घैः।
भीष्मो द्रोणः सूतपुत्रस्तथासौ
सहास्मदीयैरपि योधमुख्यैः ॥', 'amī ca tvāṃ dhṛtarāṣṭrasya putrāḥ sarve sahaivāvanipālasaṅghaiḥ
bhīṣmo droṇaḥ sūtaputrastathāsau sahāsmadīyairapi yodhamukhyaiḥ', 'and Bhīṣma and Droṇa and this charioteer''s son likewise together with our principal warriors also');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO passages (id, edition_id, corpus_version_id, canonical_ref, chapter, verse, speaker, checksum, review_status, release_eligible) VALUES ('gita.11.27', 'gita-standard-700', 'gita-1.0.0-rc.1', 'gita.11.27', 11, 27, 'Arjuna', '2acf409313d01075b8c62588e8fd758a8cba309b1b8165633e096c013396e6d1', 'first review verified; second review pending', 0);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO text_representations (passage_id, kind, language, script, content, source_id) VALUES ('gita.11.27', 'original', 'sa', 'Deva', 'वक्त्राणि ते त्वरमाणा विशन्ति
दंष्ट्राकरालानि भयानकानि।
केचिद्विलग्ना दशनान्तरेषु
सन्दृश्यन्ते चूर्णितैरुत्तमाङ्गैः ॥', 'vedic-scriptures');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO text_representations (passage_id, kind, language, script, content, source_id) VALUES ('gita.11.27', 'transliteration', 'sa', 'Latn', 'vaktrāṇi te tvaramāṇā viśanti daṃṣṭrākarālāni bhayānakāni
kecidvilagnā daśanāntareṣu sandṛśyante cūrṇitairuttamāṅgaiḥ', 'vedic-scriptures');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO text_representations (passage_id, kind, language, script, content, source_id) VALUES ('gita.11.27', 'translation', 'en', 'Latn', 'are rapidly entering your mouths fearful and horrific by (reason of your) jaws. And some with their heads smashed are seen (to be) stuck in the spaces between the teeth. As the many rapid currents of a river''s waters run towards the sea alone', 'telang-1882');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO passage_sources (passage_id, source_id, locator, role) VALUES ('gita.11.27', 'vedic-scriptures', 'BG11.27', 'Devanagari and IAST digital witness');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO passage_sources (passage_id, source_id, locator, role) VALUES ('gita.11.27', 'telang-1882', 'Chapter 11; aligned against BG11.27', 'English translation witness');
