प्रजापतिस्त्वं प्रपितामहश्च।
नमो नमस्तेऽस्तु सहस्रकृत्वः
पुनश्च भूयोऽपि नमो नमस्ते ॥', 'vāyuryamo.agnirvaruṇaḥ śaśāṅkaḥ prajāpatistvaṃ prapitāmahaśca
namo namaste.astu sahasrakṛtvaḥ punaśca bhūyo.api namo namaste', 'You are the wind, Yama , fire, Varuṇa, the moon, you Prajāpati, and the great grandsire. Obeisance be to thee a thousand times, and again and again obeisance to thee! In front and from behind obeisance to thee!');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO passages (id, edition_id, corpus_version_id, canonical_ref, chapter, verse, speaker, checksum, review_status, release_eligible) VALUES ('gita.11.40', 'gita-standard-700', 'gita-1.0.0-rc.1', 'gita.11.40', 11, 40, 'Arjuna', '168e84f4bc249a290fdb237b45c39c1625874bc49ae5181ae3a66180b3d1693c', 'first review verified; second review pending', 0);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO text_representations (passage_id, kind, language, script, content, source_id) VALUES ('gita.11.40', 'original', 'sa', 'Deva', 'नमः पुरस्तादथ पृष्ठतस्ते
नमोऽस्तु ते सर्वत एव सर्व।
अनन्तवीर्यामितविक्रमस्त्वं
सर्वं समाप्नोषि ततोऽसि सर्वः ॥', 'vedic-scriptures');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO text_representations (passage_id, kind, language, script, content, source_id) VALUES ('gita.11.40', 'transliteration', 'sa', 'Latn', 'namaḥ purastādatha pṛṣṭhataste namo.astu te sarvata eva sarva
anantavīryāmitavikramastvaṃ sarvaṃ samāpnoṣi tato.asi sarvaḥ', 'vedic-scriptures');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO text_representations (passage_id, kind, language, script, content, source_id) VALUES ('gita.11.40', 'translation', 'en', 'Latn', 'Obeisance be to thee from all sides, O you who are all! You are of infinite power, of unmeasured glory you pervade all, and therefore you are all!', 'telang-1882');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO passage_sources (passage_id, source_id, locator, role) VALUES ('gita.11.40', 'vedic-scriptures', 'BG11.40', 'Devanagari and IAST digital witness');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO passage_sources (passage_id, source_id, locator, role) VALUES ('gita.11.40', 'telang-1882', 'Chapter 11; aligned against BG11.40', 'English translation witness');
INSERT INTO passages_fts (canonical_ref, devanagari, iast, english) VALUES ('gita.11.40', 'नमः पुरस्तादथ पृष्ठतस्ते
नमोऽस्तु ते सर्वत एव सर्व।
अनन्तवीर्यामितविक्रमस्त्वं
सर्वं समाप्नोषि ततोऽसि सर्वः ॥', 'namaḥ purastādatha pṛṣṭhataste namo.astu te sarvata eva sarva
anantavīryāmitavikramastvaṃ sarvaṃ samāpnoṣi tato.asi sarvaḥ', 'Obeisance be to thee from all sides, O you who are all! You are of infinite power, of unmeasured glory you pervade all, and therefore you are all!');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO passages (id, edition_id, corpus_version_id, canonical_ref, chapter, verse, speaker, checksum, review_status, release_eligible) VALUES ('gita.11.41', 'gita-standard-700', 'gita-1.0.0-rc.1', 'gita.11.41', 11, 41, 'Arjuna', 'ebc370f0e3ff7d6cc853beacf424561e944f4745923e40932a1ee4984ed507bc', 'first review verified; second review pending', 0);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO text_representations (passage_id, kind, language, script, content, source_id) VALUES ('gita.11.41', 'original', 'sa', 'Deva', 'सखेति मत्वा प्रसभं यदुक्तं
हे कृष्ण हे यादव हे सखेति।
अजानता महिमानं तवेदं
मया प्रमादात्प्रणयेन वापि ॥', 'vedic-scriptures');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO text_representations (passage_id, kind, language, script, content, source_id) VALUES ('gita.11.41', 'transliteration', 'sa', 'Latn', 'sakheti matvā prasabhaṃ yaduktaṃ he kṛṣṇa he yādava he sakheti
ajānatā mahimānaṃ tavedaṃ mayā pramādātpraṇayena vāpi', 'vedic-scriptures');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO text_representations (passage_id, kind, language, script, content, source_id) VALUES ('gita.11.41', 'translation', 'en', 'Latn', 'Whatever I have said contemptuously,—for instance, ''O Kṛṣṇa!'' ''O Yādava !'' ''O friend!''—thinking you to be (my) friend, and not knowing your greatness (as shown in) this (universal form), or through friendliness, or incautiously', 'telang-1882');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO passage_sources (passage_id, source_id, locator, role) VALUES ('gita.11.41', 'vedic-scriptures', 'BG11.41', 'Devanagari and IAST digital witness');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO passage_sources (passage_id, source_id, locator, role) VALUES ('gita.11.41', 'telang-1882', 'Chapter 11; aligned against BG11.41', 'English translation witness');
INSERT INTO passages_fts (canonical_ref, devanagari, iast, english) VALUES ('gita.11.41', 'सखेति मत्वा प्रसभं यदुक्तं
हे कृष्ण हे यादव हे सखेति।
अजानता महिमानं तवेदं
मया प्रमादात्प्रणयेन वापि ॥', 'sakheti matvā prasabhaṃ yaduktaṃ he kṛṣṇa he yādava he sakheti
ajānatā mahimānaṃ tavedaṃ mayā pramādātpraṇayena vāpi', 'Whatever I have said contemptuously,—for instance, ''O Kṛṣṇa!'' ''O Yādava !'' ''O friend!''—thinking you to be (my) friend, and not knowing your greatness (as shown in) this (universal form), or through friendliness, or incautiously');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO passages (id, edition_id, corpus_version_id, canonical_ref, chapter, verse, speaker, checksum, review_status, release_eligible) VALUES ('gita.11.42', 'gita-standard-700', 'gita-1.0.0-rc.1', 'gita.11.42', 11, 42, 'Arjuna', '95d6f347d0f4a5de5b1250f5a7901398abfd857c0f0893c142b444f63eba25f0', 'first review verified; second review pending', 0);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO text_representations (passage_id, kind, language, script, content, source_id) VALUES ('gita.11.42', 'original', 'sa', 'Deva', 'यच्चावहासार्थमसत्कृतोऽसि
विहारशय्यासनभोजनेषु।
एकोऽथवाप्यच्युत तत्समक्षं
तत्क्षामये त्वामहमप्रमेयम् ॥', 'vedic-scriptures');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO text_representations (passage_id, kind, language, script, content, source_id) VALUES ('gita.11.42', 'transliteration', 'sa', 'Latn', 'yaccāvahāsārthamasatkṛto.asi vihāraśayyāsanabhojaneṣu
eko.athavāpyacyuta tatsamakṣaṃ tatkṣāmaye tvāmahamaprameyam', 'vedic-scriptures');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO text_representations (passage_id, kind, language, script, content, source_id) VALUES ('gita.11.42', 'translation', 'en', 'Latn', 'and whatever disrespect I have shown you for purposes of merriment on (occasions of) play sleep dinner or sitting (together) whether alone or in the presence (of friends),—for all that O undegraded one! I ask pardon of you who are indefinable.', 'telang-1882');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO passage_sources (passage_id, source_id, locator, role) VALUES ('gita.11.42', 'vedic-scriptures', 'BG11.42', 'Devanagari and IAST digital witness');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO passage_sources (passage_id, source_id, locator, role) VALUES ('gita.11.42', 'telang-1882', 'Chapter 11; aligned against BG11.42', 'English translation witness');
